---
layout: layout.njk
title: Selected Work
description: Recent Mid-Michigan closings associated with Joel Sodeman and Sodeman Realty.
---

<section class="container section">
  <h1>Selected Work</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Recent closings from Joel’s public Zillow track record
    (<a href="{{ listings.profile_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">soldbysoda</a>).
    No active for-sale listings were published there at last update ({{ listings.captured }}).
  </p>

  {% if listings.items and listings.items.length %}
    <div class="listing-grid" style="margin-top:18px">
      {% for item in listings.items %}
        <a class="listing-card" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="listing-media">
            {% if item.image %}
              <img class="listing-img" src="{{ item.image }}" alt="{{ item.image_alt or item.title }}" loading="lazy" width="640" height="480" />
            {% else %}
              <div class="listing-img listing-img--sold" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="listing-badge">{{ item.status | upper }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="listing-meta">
            <div class="listing-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
            <div class="listing-sub">{{ item.subtitle }}</div>
            <div class="listing-side">{{ item.side }} · {{ item.timing }}</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fineprint" style="margin-top:18px">
      {{ listings.source_note }}
      Details can change; confirm with Joel for current marketing use.
      <a href="{{ listings.profile_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full profile on Zillow</a>.
    </p>
  {% else %}
    <div class="empty-panel">
      <p>No selected closings are published on the site right now.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact/#schedule">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="empty-panel" style="margin-top:28px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Looking for something currently available?</h2>
    <p class="muted">Inventory moves quickly. A short consult is the fastest way to screen what’s on the market against your plan.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="tel:{{ site.phone_tel }}">Call {{ site.phone_display }}</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="/contact/#schedule">Request a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
